/**
 * Bilaspur division, South East Central Railway - the divisional master data.
 *
 * Extracted from the division's own records and not edited by hand:
 *   PAMS_DATA.xlsx        sheet 1_PAMS_DATA   station master, facilities, PwD
 *                         sheet 5_PLATFORMS   platform counts
 *   BSP_Dashboard_Data.xlsx
 *                         sheet Station_Info  category, platforms, coordinates
 *                         sheet MEA_Amenities provided against required, per the
 *                                             MEA norms (RB 2018/LM(PA)/03/06)
 *
 * Two fields are derived rather than taken from the source, because PAMS does not
 * carry them: `station_type` (HG categories are halts; a station that is an
 * endpoint of more than one section is a junction) and the display spelling of
 * the station name, which PAMS holds inconsistently (MAUHARI, Harrad, jaithari)
 * and which is title-cased here. The code is what identifies a station, and it is
 * untouched.
 *
 * All of it is ordinary master data: Admin -> Stations -> Import replaces the
 * whole list from a CSV, and every field is editable from the Admin Panel.
 */

